# aligned_lex_hf: bcv-commons/lexeme-alignments (HF) ingest, ~924 languages (scripts/build_aligned_lex_hf.py)
# — too large to commit (~2GB at the existing aligned_lex/ per-language rate); re-derivable, pinned
# to whatever's published on HF at ingest time. Contrast with resources/aligned_lex/ (~10 languages,
# Clear-Bible-manual-sourced, small enough to commit, kept tracked).
resources/aligned_lex_hf/
# languages.db builder: downloaded source cache + the built .db (re-derivable; .tsv stay tracked)
resources/languages/_raw/
resources/languages/*.db
